     [38;5;246mSurvives reload and browser restart, shared across tabs, cleared on explicit logout. Treated as a cache; the server
[39m     [38;5;246mstays the source of truth.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m sessionStorage
     [38;5;246mSurvives reload but is scoped to one tab and cleared when it closes. No stale state; a new tab appears logged out.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m In-memory only
     [38;5;246mA module variable, lost on reload. Simplest and never stale, but not actually persistent.[39m
